  "details": "This is a pretty significant bug.\n\nFinalik avatar seems to break the game. when I switch into it, it first of all, does not render in the mirror or in the camera. though others see it fine.\n\nSecond, there is a static duplicate that does not move.\n\nthird, once you switch out of the avatar, the duplicate remains, and your own avatar now does not render properly in the mirror or camera. when you switch, it locks the ik in either as well. Only rejoining the world seems to fix it.\n\nHere's a video of it in action\n\nhttps://streamable.com/3c24pg",
